   "text": "California State University San Marcos (CSUSM) - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nCalifornia State University San Marcos (CSUSM)\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nBuilding on an innovative 30-year history, California State University San Marcos is a forward-focused institution, dedicated to preparing future leaders, building great communities and solving critical issues. Located on a 304-acre hillside overlooking the city of San Marcos, the University is just a short distance from some of Southern California’s best beaches and an hour from the U.S.-Mexico border. CSUSM enrollment is over 16,000 and the university is fully accredited by the Western Association of Schools and Colleges.\nCalifornia State University San Marcos is located in northern San Diego County and offers beautiful beaches, an hour drive to the mountains and desert, a downtown nightlife, world-class shopping, and more all within a short trip from campus!\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n31/03/2026 11:28\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n31/03/2026 11:28\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nUnited States\nYearly Fees\nMax: US$31,515.00\nMin: US$18,160.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n10%\n1,500 of 15,400 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nStudy Group\nFounded Year\n1989\nCampus(es)\nSan Marcos\nCountry\nUnited States\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n01/04/2026\nContract End Date\n31/12/2026\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://www.csusm.edu/housing/index.html\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://www.csusm.edu/finaid/scholarships/index.html\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/user/csusm\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\nApplication Fee: $70",
